# Keeps this directory in git.
#
# fluvi-app/Dockerfile does `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`, but public/
# was never committed, so a fresh clone could not build:
#   Error: building at STEP "COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public":
#   copier: stat: "/app/public": no such file or directory
# Next.js treats public/ as optional static assets, so an empty dir is correct.
